				},
				{
					"id": 207420702,
					"content": "呃，怎…怎了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						207420703
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 207420703,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}！唐娜都告訴我了，她看見{F#妳}{M#你}把蒲公英都吹跑了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						207420704
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙蘿拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 207420704,
					"content": "抱歉，那個…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						207420705
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 207420705,
					"content": "#唐娜都告訴我了，是{F#妳}{M#你}把蒲公英都吹跑的對吧？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						207420706
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙蘿拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 207420706,
					"content": "#要是{F#妳}{M#你}需要蒲公英籽，那就野外採不就好了，這可是我專門照顧了好久的花！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						207420707
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙蘿拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 207420707,
					"content": "#而且…這盆花的花籽還是{F#妳}{M#你}幫我蒐集的…{F#妳}{M#你}就這麼對它嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
